    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Jun 2024 23:49:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hi我回来啦！这期真的是很重磅的一期，大家听到就是赚到！！而且里面有不少彩蛋哦！大家别忘了在投票区让我知道你们的想法，这样能帮助我筛选出更符合大家口味的内容。下面是本期内容的时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一部分：关于“编故事” <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">0:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>同事范本：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">2:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我的实践：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">13:17</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>第二部分：优秀育儿资源分享 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">20:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>英文绘本：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. Cars and things that go--Stefan Lohr 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Kipper’s A to Z, an alphabet adventure—Mick Inkpen 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>英文书籍：母女系列 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>1. How to talk so kids will listen &amp; listen so kids will talk—Adele Faber (Mom)</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. How to talk so little kids will listen—Joanna Faber &amp; Julie King (Daughter and her friend)</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌曲分享: <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>1. Sesame Street 芝麻街： community song—Mickey Guyton</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Barney(芝麻街中玫红色的恐龙）—The clean up song</span></p>]]></description>
